eading", "settings": {"title": "Nouă localități, de la Dunăre în sus până la munte", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_element_id": "localitati-titlu"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zvra011", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Focșaniul e reședința și nodul de pe DN2. Adjudul stă în nord, la granița cu Bacăul, iar Mărășeștiul între ele. Odobești, Panciu și Jariștea sunt în podgorie, pe dealuri, iar Vidra, Soveja și Tulnici urcă spre munte, pe văi.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=quote"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "zvra013", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-10 max-w-4xl\">\n<ul class=\"motif-list grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-8 gap-y-4\">\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Focșani</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Adjud</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Mărășești</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Odobești</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Panciu</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Jariștea</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Vidra</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Soveja</li>\n<li class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg\">Tulnici</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"motif-rule max-w-[180px] w-full mt-8\"><span class=\"motif-rule__gem zona-gem\"></span></div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-6\">Pentru o comună care nu e pe listă, reperul e treapta de relief: cele din câmpie și din podgorie se deservesc de pe DN2, cele de munte pe valea care duce la ele. Drumul pe vale nu se măsoară în kilometri, ci în timp.</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-6\">La Adjud, în nordul județului, am cântat la Ballroom President.</p>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zvra014", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Spre sud, dincolo de Milcov, începe <a href=\"/zone/buzau/\">Buzău</a> — vechea graniță dintre cele două țări românești, și exact pe acolo trece muzica de care e vorba mai jos. Spre nord, pe DN2, Adjudul e la o jumătate de oră de <a href=\"/zone/bacau/\">Bacău</a>, iar spre est drumul coboară prin Mărășești către <a href=\"/zone/galati/\">Galați</a>.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "32", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "32", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "32", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zvra015", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><p class=\"mt-8\"><a class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px]\" href=\"/zone/\">Toate zonele deservite</a></p></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zvra018", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zvra017", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zvra01a", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zvra019", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block mb-4\">Repertoriu</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-2xl md:text-headline-lg leading-tight mb-6\" id=\"repertoriu-titlu\">Locul de unde pleacă muzica spre sud</h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant\">Repertoriul moldovenesc nu ajunge în Muntenia din senin: coboară pe drumuri, iar unul dintre ele trece pe aici. Vecinătatea dintre Vrancea și Buzău e chiar motivul pentru care, la o nuntă buzoiană, se cer hore moldovenești alături de cele muntenești. Diferența e că, la sud de Milcov, blocul acela e un adaos; la nord, în Vrancea, e repertoriul obișnuit al serii.</p>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug mt-9 mb-4\">Ce înseamnă asta pentru o sală din Focșani</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant\">Că într-o seară de aici încap amândouă registrele fără să pară un compromis. O familie venită dinspre Râmnicu Sărat și una din Adjud pot cere lucruri diferite, iar programul le pune una după alta, nu amestecate. Ce se schimbă concret în melodie sau în pas la trecerea Milcovului e o întrebare la care nu răspundem din birou: <span class=\"ph\">[afirmație de folclor — de validat de Ioana]</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"mt-8\"><a class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px]\" href=\"/repertoriu/\">Vezi repertoriul complet</a></p>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zvra01c", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zvra01b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zvra022", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zvra020", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "width": {"unit": "px", "size": 768, "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "48", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "48", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "32", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "custom_css": "selector{max-width:100%}"}, "elements": [{"id": "zvra01d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Logistică", "header_size": "div", "title_color": "#C6C6C6", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Inter", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 14, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "600", "typography_text_transform": "uppercase", "typography_letter_spacing": {"unit": "em", "size": 0.2, "sizes": []}, "typography_line_height": {"unit": "px", "size": 20, "sizes": []}, "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zvra01e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Trei trepte de relief, trei feluri de drum", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_element_id": "logistica-titlu"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zvra01f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pe DN2, până la Focșani, drumul e continuu și previzibil. În podgorie se ramifică pe drumuri județene scurte. Spre munte, pe văile Putnei și ale Milcovului, timpul de parcurs nu mai e proporțional cu distanța. Kilometrajul se tarifează la 6 lei, pe traseul complet, tur și retur.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "zvra021", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-gutter max-w-4xl\">\n<div class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">Distanță</span>\n<p class=\"font-display-lg text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface\">~190 km din București</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Distanța rutieră până la Focșani. Pentru Adjud și pentru satele de munte se adaugă drumul din interiorul județului, care se calculează pe adresa exactă a sălii.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">Deplasare</span>\n<p class=\"font-headline-md text-xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface\">Echipamentul pleacă cu o marjă pe văi</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Tehnicienii urcă primii, cu tot echipamentul greu. Partea artistică pleacă separat, pe un orar calculat înapoi de la ora la care scena e gata. Unde se merge pe vale, marja nu se ia din kilometraj, ci din starea drumului.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 md:col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">Cazare</span>\n<p class=\"font-headline-md text-xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface\">Depinde de treapta pe care e sala</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Din oraș și din podgorie se coboară înapoi spre București după eveniment, fără probleme. De sus, de pe văi, și mai ales după un final târziu, nu: atunci camerele intră pe listă la organizare. <span class=\"ph\">[CAZARE VRANCEA — de confirmat]</span></p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">E linia care nu se poate anunța dinainte: depinde de altitudinea locației și de ceas, nu de tipul evenimentului.</p>\n</div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zvra024", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zvra023", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zvra026", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zvra025", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-12 text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-5\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">Pachete</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-2xl md:text-headline-lg leading-tight\" id=\"pachete-titlu\">Același pachet pe toate cele trei trepte</h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-lg text-base md:text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant\">Configurațiile nu se schimbă între câmpie, podgorie și munte. Ce se schimbă e linia de transport, calculată pe adresa sălii, și, uneori, o noapte de cazare.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Ce se cântă într-o seară ține mai puțin de județ și mai mult de motivul pentru care s-a strâns lumea. Altfel arată programul la o <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/nunta/\">nuntă</a>, altfel la un <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/botez/\">botez</a>, altfel la <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/eveniment-privat/\">o petrecere în familie</a> și altfel la <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/corporate/\">un eveniment de firmă</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"motif-rule max-w-[180px] w-full\"><span class=\"motif-rule__gem zona-gem\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto\">\n<a class=\"inline-block text-center whitespace-nowrap bg-accent text-white px-8 md:px-10 py-4 uppercase font-label-md text-label-md tracking-widest hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"/oferte/\">Vezi toate pachetele</a>\n<a class=\"btn-secundar-zona inline-block text-center whitespace-nowrap text-on-surface bg-transparent px-8 md:px-10 py-4 uppercase font-label-md text-label-md tracking-widest hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"/contact/\">Cere ofertă</a>\n</div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zvra028", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zvra027", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zvra033", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zvra02b", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "width": {"unit": "px", "size": 768, "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "48", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "48", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "32", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "custom_css": "selector{max-width:100%}"}, "elements": [{"id": "zvra029", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Întrebări", "header_size": "div", "title_color": "#C6C6C6", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Inter", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 14, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "600", "typography_text_transform": "uppercase", "typography_letter_spacing": {"unit": "em", "size": 0.2, "sizes": []}, "typography_line_height": {"unit": "px", "size": 20, "sizes": []}, "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zvra02a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Milcovul, podgoria și drumul spre munte", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_element_id": "faq-titlu"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "zvra031", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "width": {"unit": "px", "size": 768, "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "custom_css": "selector{max-width:100%}", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zvra02c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"faq-item\"><details open><summary aria-expanded=\"true\"><h3>Avem rude și din Buzău, și din Bacău. Se poate cânta pentru amândouă părțile?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 -960 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M480-357.85 253.85-584l32.61-32.61L480-423.08l193.54-193.53L706.15-584 480-357.85Z\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-item__answer\"><p>Da, și e situația obișnuită aici. Vrancea e chiar locul unde cele două repertorii se ating, iar o seară de la Focșani le ține pe amândouă.</p>\n<p>Nu le amestecăm însă în același bloc: se pun unul după altul, în momente separate, ca fiecare grup să-și recunoască jocurile.</p></div></details></div>", "custom_css": "selector{margin-bottom:16px}selector h3{margin:0;padding-right:16px;font-family:\"EB Garamond\",Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375;color:var(--e-global-color-primary)}@media(min-width:768px){selector h3{font-size:24px}}selector .faq-item__answer{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}selector .faq-item__answer p{margin:0}selector .faq-item__answer p+p{margin-top:12px}"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zvra02d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary aria-expanded=\"false\"><h3>Nunta e la Soveja, sus în munți. Ajungeți acolo?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 -960 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M480-357.85 253.85-584l32.61-32.61L480-423.08l193.54-193.53L706.15-584 480-357.85Z\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-item__answer\"><p>Da. Ce se schimbă față de Focșani nu e ruta, ci timpul: pe vale, kilometrii nu mai spun cât durează drumul.</p>\n<p>Dacă petrecerea ține până târziu, nimeni nu pornește la vale noaptea. E un punct pe care îl deschidem la prima discuție.</p></div></details></div>", "custom_css": "selector{margin-bottom:16px}selector h3{margin:0;padding-right:16px;font-family:\"EB Garamond\",Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375;color:var(--e-global-color-primary)}@media(min-width:768px){selector h3{font-size:24px}}selector .faq-item__answer{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}selector .faq-item__answer p{margin:0}selector .faq-item__answer p+p{margin-top:12px}"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zvra02e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary aria-expanded=\"false\"><h3>Facem petrecerea în octombrie, la o cramă din Odobești. Contează ceva anume?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 -960 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M480-357.85 253.85-584l32.61-32.61L480-423.08l193.54-193.53L706.15-584 480-357.85Z\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-item__answer\"><p>Pentru muzică, nu. Pentru montaj, da: ne interesează unde se ridică scena, dacă spațiul e acoperit și ce sursă de curent există.</p>\n<p>În podgorie, la sfârșit de octombrie, contează și temperatura de seară — o parte din program se poate muta înăuntru.</p></div></details></div>", "custom_css": "selector{margin-bottom:16px}selector h3{margin:0;padding-right:16px;font-family:\"EB Garamond\",Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375;color:var(--e-global-color-primary)}@media(min-width:768px){selector h3{font-size:24px}}selector .faq-item__answer{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}selector .faq-item__answer p{margin:0}selector .faq-item__answer p+p{margin-top:12px}"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zvra02f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary aria-expanded=\"false\"><h3>Ce înseamnă că suntem „la hotar”? Se cântă altfel decât la Bacău?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 -960 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M480-357.85 253.85-584l32.61-32.61L480-423.08l193.54-193.53L706.15-584 480-357.85Z\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-item__answer\"><p>Înseamnă că aici se cer, firesc, și jocuri care în sud trec drept „moldovenești”, și altele pe care le știe toată câmpia.</p>\n<p>Cât de mult se schimbă efectiv melodia peste Milcov e o întrebare de folclor la care nu răspundem noi. Ce putem spune e cum construim programul: după lista de invitați, nu după județ.</p></div></details></div>", "custom_css": "selector{margin-bottom:16px}selector h3{margin:0;padding-right:16px;font-family:\"EB Garamond\",Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375;color:var(--e-global-color-primary)}@media(min-width:768px){selector h3{font-size:24px}}selector .faq-item__answer{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}selector .faq-item__answer p{margin:0}selector .faq-item__answer p+p{margin-top:12px}"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zvra030", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary aria-expanded=\"false\"><h3>Sala e la Adjud, nu în Focșani. Se schimbă drumul sau prețul?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 -960 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M480-357.85 253.85-584l32.61-32.61L480-423.08l193.54-193.53L706.15-584 480-357.85Z\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-item__answer\"><p>Ruta rămâne pe DN2, doar că se continuă spre nord. Kilometrii se calculează pe adresa reală, la 6 lei/km dus-întors.</p>\n<p>Adjudul e mai aproape de Bacău decât de Focșani, deci pentru invitații din nord poate fi chiar mai comod.</p></div></details></div>", "custom_css": "selector{margin-bottom:16px}selector h3{margin:0;padding-right:16px;font-family:\"EB Garamond\",Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375;color:var(--e-global-color-primary)}@media(min-width:768px){selector h3{font-size:24px}}selector .faq-item__answer{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}selector .faq-item__answer p{margin:0}selector .faq-item__answer p+p{margin-top:12px}"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "zvra032", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"mt-10 md:mt-12\">\n<a class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px]\" href=\"/faq/\">Vezi toate întrebările frecvente <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[18px]\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"1em\" style=\"vertical-align:-.125em\" viewbox=\"0 -960 960 960\" width=\"1em\"><path d=\"M693.69-457.31H180v-45.38h513.69L448.39-748 480-780l300 300-300 300-31.61-32 245.3-245.31Z\"></path></svg></a>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "zvra037", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 624, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "flex_align_items": "center", "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#1C1B1B", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surfacealt"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#1C1B1B}selector{border-top:1px solid rgba(68,71,72,.1)}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "96", "right": "24", "bottom": "96", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "96", "right": "24", "bottom": "96", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "64", "right": "24", "bottom": "64", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "zvra034", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "De la Milcov până sub munte", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=primary"}, "align": "center", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "20", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "20", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "20", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zvra035", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Avem nevoie de trei lucruri: comuna sau orașul, adresa exactă a sălii și ziua. Cu ele iese pe loc răspunsul despre dată liberă, kilometraj și eventuala noapte de cazare.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=quote"}, "align": "center", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "40", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "40", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0",